{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the proud owner of a building. Through cutting-edge simulation technology, you can experience the following:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at your building in stunning 3D with rotation and zoom controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a nice song. Or mute it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmetics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you observe your building for long enough, you will unlock new skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your building into a bustling mall, a frozen apartment, an overgrown skyscraper and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, market or hoard your skins for eternity.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566300?t=1756939925","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566300?t=1756939925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566300/0a2597688031d4f01697187719edd4454a226118/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756939925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566300/0a2597688031d4f01697187719edd4454a226118/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756939925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the proud owner of a building. Through cutting-edge simulation technology, you can experience the following:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at your building in stunning 3D with rotation and zoom controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a nice song. Or mute it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmetics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you observe your bui